# Vendored / build output. These are already git-ignored (see .gitignore)
# so default `semgrep` runs (git-tracked files only) never see them, but
# listing them here keeps the exclusion correct even when semgrep is run
# with --no-git-ignore or against an untracked copy of the tree.
**/node_modules/**
**/.nuxt/**
**/.output/**

# Dependency manifests and lockfiles stay visible to connected Supply Chain
# analysis even when their packages contain otherwise ignored generated code.
